  "about": "Every sentence a person reads in the zzThat apps and the zzThis web client. Clients build their string catalogs from this file at the pinned commit and do not write their own. Keys are stable; iOS uses the key as written and Android replaces dots with underscores. {provider} and {email} are filled in at run time. Rows whose source is INFERRED are new on 2026-10-04 and wait for Michael's review. Rules: say demo, say check word, no em dashes, codes in lowercase.",
